WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Slack MCP connects your AI client to Slack through your browser session.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Ask for unread triage, important threads, searches, and next actions without opening Slack.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Use 21 self-hosted tools for channels, DMs, reactions, replies, workflow profiles, and hosted upgrade prompts.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Install with npx -y @jtalk22/slack-mcp --setup and keep the local workflow under your control.
